e globe whenever you need a moment of peace. Listen to the waves in Portugal, watch the sunset in Costa Rica, experience the rugged beauty of Iceland, and discover many more breathtaking destinations.\n\nSimply sit by the water and breathe, or choose from guided meditations, gratitude practices, mindfulness exercises, calming music, and simple rituals designed to help you relax, reflect, and reconnect.\n\n**No travel. No planning. Just beach time, anytime you need it.**\n\nQuestions or comments? hello@gratitui.com\n", "short_description": "Sometimes all you need is a beach.\n\nThat's why we created Gratitui.\n\nBeautiful real-world beaches from around the globe whenever you need a moment of peace. Listen to the waves in Portugal, watch the sunset in Costa Rica, and many more breathtaking destinations.\n\nSimply sit by the water and breathe, or choose from guided meditations, gratitude practices, calming music, and simple rituals designed to help you relax and restore.\n\nNo travel. No planning. Just beach time, anytime you need it."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.praiavr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "PraiaVR Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.praiavr.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.praiavr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": 